    featuredImagePrompt: "Dynamic, high-angle shot of a modern, bustling Indian stock exchange trading floor, with large digital screens displaying real-time Nifty 50 index data and a prominent (stylized, non-logo) representation of a rising 'Jio' curve. Traders in business attire are focused on screens, an atmosphere of controlled excitement and high stakes. Emphasize digital interfaces and data visualization, reflecting the technological backbone of modern finance. Include subtle visual cues indicating growth and investor optimism. The scene should be vibrant, professional, and distinctly Indian in context, without being cliché. Avoid direct company logos. Focus on the *industry* of stock trading and investment in India, showing depth and movement.",
