    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the convergence of diverse scientific breakthroughs. In the center, a luminous, interconnected network of abstract data streams and light, symbolizing discovery. Emanating from and around it are stylized, ethereal representations: one side features a glowing DNA helix intertwining with a human silhouette, symbolizing health and longevity science (Lupus cure, longevity). Another side shows abstract chemical structures transforming from a gaseous cloud into refined, crystalline forms, representing methane-to-medicine. A third element depicts a stylized, glowing asteroid fragment with subtle celestial background, representing NASA's Bennu revelations. The overall aesthetic should be futuristic, hopeful, and interconnected, with a rich color palette of blues, purples, and greens, avoiding literal interpretations or people in labs. Focus on the interplay and synergy of these scientific advancements.",
