    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic editorial news layout featuring a split screen. On one side, a stylized digital representation of Bitcoin and Ethereum logos surging upwards with green upward trend arrows, against a backdrop of a global market graph. On the other side, a subtle, high-tech abstract depiction of interconnected corporate symbols (representing institutional finance) and a faint outline of a rocket or futuristic car (representing SpaceX/Tesla speculation). The overall aesthetic should be professional, clean, and convey a sense of significant financial movement and technological innovation. Use a color palette of deep blues, greens, and subtle golds. Avoid any specific human faces or overt brand logos beyond the crypto symbols.",
