    featuredImagePrompt: "A sophisticated, data-driven infographic. The central element is a glowing, abstract network of AI connections spanning a subtly visible world map, with concentrated nodes over India, the United States, United Kingdom, Canada, and Australia. Overlayed are clean, modern graphs and charts illustrating a steep upward curve representing the '$6 Trillion AI Buildout' and 'Anthropic IPO' as a prominent data point. Incorporate subtle visual cues (e.g., a balanced scale or intertwined gears) symbolizing ethical considerations and the delicate balance between innovation and responsibility. The aesthetic should be futuristic, professional, and visually engaging, using a palette of deep blues, purples, and electric greens to highlight data points.",
