    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing global geopolitical tension and diplomatic upheaval. Show a shattered globe with fractured continents, specifically highlighting Venezuela and North America. Abstract representations of military intervention (like subtle energy lines or a shattered barrier) emanate from one region, impacting others. Surrounding the globe are blurred, abstract symbols of international law and diplomacy, appearing strained or broken. The color palette should be muted, reflecting urgency and gravity, with hints of red for conflict and blue/green for hope or diplomacy, but predominantly somber tones. The style is modern, abstract, and thought-provoking, avoiding literal depictions of violence. Focus on the idea of broken international norms and interconnected global consequences. Ensure no identifiable faces or specific military hardware.",
