    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing diverse medical breakthroughs: a subtle blend of a stylized human brain, DNA helix structures, a faint outline of the International Space Station orbiting Earth, microscopic cellular elements, and a stylized clock or moon phase symbolizing sleep. The color palette should be harmonious, featuring blues, greens, and subtle purples, conveying innovation, health, and global reach. Avoid any specific product or person. The composition should be dynamic yet clean, suggesting interconnectedness and progress. It should be abstract enough to convey future potential without being overly futuristic or sci-fi.",
