    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual, data-driven visual representing the intersection of data privacy, AI ethics, and a massive financial penalty. Imagine a futuristic, glowing infographic overlaying a stylized abstract network of interconnected data points. In the foreground, a prominent digital display shows '25,000,000,000 USD' with a digital lock icon, symbolizing the Meta fine and data security. Surrounding this, abstract visual elements like flowing data streams, human silhouettes fading into digital code, and subtle representations of algorithmic structures (neural networks) are present. The color palette should be deep blues, purples, and electric greens, suggesting both digital complexity and ethical urgency. The composition should be clean and impactful, suitable for an editorial news layout, emphasizing data transparency and the scale of the fine.",
