    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing financial uncertainty and portfolio adjustments in the context of artificial intelligence. Imagine a complex, glowing AI brain or network at the center, with cracks or fissures appearing, symbolizing \'funding fears\'. Around it, abstract financial graphs or arrows are shifting direction, some pointing downwards from the AI core, others pointing upwards towards solid, foundational blocks (representing defensive assets). Include subtle elements like a stylized \'Wall Street\' skyline in the background, out of focus. Use a color palette of deep blues, purples, and electric greens for AI, contrasting with muted greys and golds for market shifts, to convey both innovation and caution. The overall mood should be thoughtful and slightly apprehensive, not alarmist. High detail, digital art style, volumetric lighting.",
