    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the intersection and tension between traditional finance and blockchain technology. On one side, classic corporate logos (Microsoft, Google, McDonald\'s, Goldman Sachs, Wells Fargo) are subtly blurred or partially obscured, representing their \'wait-and-see\' approach or rejection. On the other side, glowing, interconnected blockchain nodes and digital ledger lines are visible, with a symbolic gate or barrier between the two worlds. The overall mood should be analytical and forward-looking, with a clean, modern aesthetic. Avoid any specific company product or overly negative imagery. Focus on the concept of \'caution\' or \'hesitation\' at the boundary of innovation. Use cool blues and greens for blockchain, and muted grays/silvers for traditional finance elements.",
