      keyRisks: ["Widespread loss of confidence in hardware wallets.", "Uncontrolled proliferation of malicious AI agents.", "Onerous and poorly conceived crypto regulations.", "Escalation of \'dirty politics\' associated with crypto funding.", "Failure of the industry to collaboratively address systemic security flaws."],
