      tokenUtility: "Bitcoin\'s primary utility lies in its role as a decentralized, censorship-resistant store of value and a global payment network. Ether\'s utility is multifaceted, acting as \'gas\' for transactions on the Ethereum network, a staking asset for network security (post-Merge), and the foundational currency for its vast DeFi and NFT ecosystems.",
