      neutralCase: "A neutral perspective suggests a period of continued volatility and consolidation. While institutional adoption progresses with Sberbank, regulatory frameworks remain evolving and restrictive in many regions. The market is caught between fundamental advancements in crypto technology and significant external pressures from macroeconomics and traditional equity market sentiment. Prices may fluctuate within a range, reacting sharply to news but lacking a strong directional catalyst in either direction until clearer trends emerge from economic data or tech sector re-evaluations.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "The outlook is moderately bearish in the short term, with a 50% probability of continued volatility influenced by macro data and tech sector jitters, 30% probability of further downside if CPI is unfavorable or AI concerns escalate, and 20% probability of a bullish rebound driven by unexpected positive news or strong institutional inflows. The long-term outlook remains cautiously optimistic due to ongoing innovation and institutional interest.",
