      vestingAnalysis: "The article references the ENS DAO proposing an upgrade, which is a protocol-level change rather than a specific token vesting event. However, general vesting schedules for ENS tokens released to the DAO treasury and contributors are public and managed by the DAO, minimizing sudden unlock risks for the core protocol, but specific token unlocks for various projects can impact market liquidity.",
