      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "We assign a 50% probability to a \'Neutral\' outlook, where the industry continues to navigate a turbulent path, achieving incremental improvements in security and regulation while still battling persistent issues. A 30% probability is given to a \'Bearish\' scenario, especially if regulatory clampdowns intensify without clear frameworks, or if major security breaches become more frequent. A 20% probability is assigned to a \'Bullish\' scenario, where current challenges catalyze rapid maturation and widespread adoption due to significantly improved trust and security infrastructure.",
